[[File:SeaSkiff-CGSWG.png|thumb|right|300px|A sea skiff]]
A '''sea skiff,''' or '''sea skimmer,''' was a type of [[skiff]] used for travel across [[ocean]]s. The members of [[Company 77]], former [[First Order]] [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtroopers]] who resided on the ocean [[moon]] [[Kef Bir]], owned two custom-created sea skiffs cobbled together from the remains of vehicles found in the [[Death Star ruins|wreckage]] of the [[DS-2 Death Star II Mobile Battle Station]].<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref>

